-- race detector (a named P5 criterion) --
        -race needs cgo and remote_build_test is CGO_ENABLED=0 by design, so the
        instrumented binary is built NATIVELY on each host from git archive HEAD — the
        same mechanism gate-p3 uses for its OpenBLAS harness. The dev host's own run is
        kept as well: it is arm64 and scalar-only, but the worker pool, the shared
        packed-B panel and the sync.Pool are backend-independent Go, so having two
        architectures' schedulers look at the same concurrency is worth the minute.
